  Description: Most ghorans have bodies of pliable vines and tough stems, but you're
    covered in sturdy, rough bark and your legs are stable as roots. You gain a +2
    circumstance bonus on your Fortitude or Reflex DC against attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple]
    or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip] you. This bonus also applies
    to saving throws against effects that would Grab you, Restrain you, or knock
    you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. You also gain a +2 circumstance
    bonus on Acrobatics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Balance].
